# .dockerignore — keep the build context small and free of local state. The **/ prefix matters: bin/ alone only
# matches the top level, and a nested obj/ (with a local project.assets.json) breaks a cross-platform restore.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dev-dist
**/TestResults
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.example.json
data/
.git
